DISCLAIMER:

This software is designed to provide disaster risk information for Tunisia.
It is intended for informational and humanitarian purposes only. The developers
and contributors are not liable for any damages, losses, or consequences arising
from the use of this software.

Users should:
- Always verify alerts with official authorities (Civil Protection, Tunisian Meteorology)
- Not rely solely on this platform for emergency decisions
- Understand that false positives and false negatives may occur
- Use this as a complementary tool alongside official warning systems

For official disaster information in Tunisia, please contact:
- Civil Protection: 198 (emergency number)
- Tunisian Meteorology: https://www.meteo.tn/
- Tunisian Red Crescent: https://www.croissant-rouge.tn/
